# D-142: a shebang-based script (#!/usr/bin/env bash) breaks if checked out with CRLF line
# endings -- Windows' own git config (core.autocrlf=true, this repo's own default so far)
# would otherwise silently convert it on checkout for any Windows contributor, corrupting
# the shebang and any string comparison that reads a line from a file. Forced to LF
# regardless of the checking-out machine's own autocrlf setting -- every other file kind in
# this repo keeps its existing (untouched) behavior.
*.sh text eol=lf
